* Mirrors source/trials/20260902/xschem/eeg_tg_lowq.spice (with the A-side
* dummy pair) with the deck conventions (SI units, bulk = VSS via lvs_sub).
.subckt eeg_tg_lowq A B EN ENB VDD18 VSS
